===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Fidough|97}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Rear Kick''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Rapidash|44}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
